---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact aiPressHQ"
  description="Contact aiPressHQ about corrections, sources, permissions, and editorial questions."
>
  <section class="legal-page" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <span class="label">aiPressHQ / Contact</span>
      <h1 id="contact-title">Contact aiPressHQ</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">A direct line for readers and sources.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose legal-body">
      <p>
        The best way to reach aiPressHQ is by email. Please include the relevant article URL when
        your message is about a specific story so it can reach the right review queue quickly.
      </p>

      <h2>Corrections and source notes</h2>
      <p>
        If you spot a factual error, a changed product detail, or a source we should examine, email
        <a href="mailto:hello@aipresshq.com">hello@aipresshq.com</a> with the article link and the evidence
        that supports the correction.
      </p>

      <h2>Permissions and press</h2>
      <p>
        For quotation, republication, partnership, or press enquiries, use the same address. Please
        describe the intended use and include any relevant deadline or publication details.
      </p>

      <h2>General questions</h2>
      <p>
        Reader questions, feedback about the site, and accessibility notes are welcome at
        <a href="mailto:hello@aipresshq.com">hello@aipresshq.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
